{"version":1,"key":"card:658","content":{"id":658,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"img","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性是用来完成"},{"type":"formatted","text":"响应式图片","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"的核心技术，需要配合 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使用。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在下载图片的时候，浏览器可能还不知道需要下载多大的图片，这个时候就可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性来对浏览器进行提示，浏览器结合视口大小和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，以及 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中定义的查询条件找到图片会被渲染为什么大小，然后根据大小去 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中找到对应的图片进行下载。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<img \n  srcset=\"elva-320w.jpg 320w,\n          elva-480w.jpg 480w,\n          elva-800w.jpg 800w\"\n  sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 280px,\n         (max-width: 1000px) 440px,\n         800px\"\n  src=\"elva-800w.jpg\" \n  alt=\"Elva\"\n/>","language":"HTML","uuid":"ebd0264e-038e-42c9-835e-8d69472137d4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"假设当前视口的大小是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"375px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"2","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，首先匹配 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，符合 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"max-width: 600px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么渲染的图片大小是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"280px","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dpr","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 渲染的图片像素大小是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"280 * 2 = 560","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，根据 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的定义，发现只有 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"800w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的图片符合要求，因此浏览器会下载 elva-800w.jpg 这张图片。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么在下载图片的时候不知道渲染多大的图片，当主解析器在处理 HTML 文档时，另一个轻量级的预加载扫描器会快速扫描后面的代码，寻找 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<img>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"<link>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","text":"<script>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 等外部资源的 URL，目的是为了浏览器在构建 DOM 的时候就能提前把这些大文件提前进行下载准备好，因此当准备下载图片的时候可能 CSS 资源正在进行网络传输，还没有构建出 DOM 和 CSSDOM 树，不知道图片会被渲染为多大。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"注意事项："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性仅仅是对浏览器的提示，不会影响真正的渲染尺寸，真正的渲染尺寸还是由 CSS 决定。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中不能使用百分比单位，如果想表示相对于视口的大小，则应该使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"vw","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果没有设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性，或者 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"srcset","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 使用的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"1x，2x","code":true},{"text":" 这种倍率描述符，那么 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"sizes","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性会被忽略。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["HTML/img/sizes","浏览器/渲染机制"],"createTime":1767357016730,"updateTime":1767361421820,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1767361421820}}